msgstr "Open <strong>TaxoCommerce Core → Suppliers</strong> if Core is active, or the separate <strong>TaxoCommerce Suppliers</strong> menu. The admin URL is <code>admin.php?page=taxocommerce-suppliers</code>. You need permission to manage WooCommerce or site settings."

