msgstr "Select rows on the current page, choose <strong>Accept / link to WooCommerce</strong>, <strong>Mark for review</strong>, <strong>Discard</strong> or <strong>Return to pending</strong>, then click <strong>Apply</strong>. Check the processed and failed counts. <em>Select all rows on this page</em> does not select the entire catalogue."

